      "limits": [
        "Vimpel's rectangular ephemeris (J2000 positions every 600 s, seven days) is position-only (STATE_VECTOR_SIZE 3) and is what analysis/od fits; the printed positions are rounded, so no velocity is made of them.",
        "normalize_orbits gives the osculating elements as one J2000 state per object, named vimpel:<id>. They are not mean elements and are not offered to SGP4 or to this flow: they are the epoch products of the $CAT integrator's identity step. read_datefirst gives the NORAD to Vimpel crosswalk as candidate links, never as assertions.",
        "Vimpel states no covariance (two 50 % scalars that give none): the pooled model answers (rule 4), uncalibrated for a lineage E14 did not measure.",
        "analysis/od gives an element set fitted to an OEM that names no NORAD number the placeholder NORAD 99999 and designator 99999A. The object is Vimpel's vimpel:<id> (OBJECT_NAME); a host must not read 99999 as a catalog number, and the integrator joins only through a link."
      ]
